    "image_text_qprqQp": {
      "type": "image-text",
      "name": "上下结构图文",
      "settings": {
        "header": "<p>FANY — Live in Your Rhythm</p>",
        "text": "<p>At FANY, we believe technology should adapt to women, not the other way around. That's why we create more than a smartwatch; we create a companion that understands women. FANY was made for women who refuse to choose between beauty and functionality.<br/><br/>We track what actually matters to you: sleep, emotion, heart rate, your natural cycle and more, not to define who you should be, but to help you stay connected to yourself. Right after a workout, know if you hit your zone. Every night, understand how you actually rested. Every day, hear what your body is telling you.<br/><br/>Built by a team of women who know this firsthand: when your body, your style, and your life move in sync, your confidence shows — quietly, naturally.<br/><br/>We grow together. We lift each other. We shine as one.<br/>FANY, See the Vibe.</p>",
        "img_first": true,
        "img_has_back": false,
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "back_color": "",
        "font_color": "#1e0e06",
        "title_font_size": 40,
        "text_font_size": 20,
        "text_width": 1100,
        "img_text_margin": 75,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 36,
        "mobile_header": "<p>FANY, see the vibe.</p>",
        "mobile_text": "<p>Life flows through every moment —leading at work, laughing at home, or savoring a quiet pause, FANY stands with you.<br/><br/>Created for women, FANY is more than a smartwatch; it’s a companion that truly understands you, staying in tune with your body’s rhythm. A gentle reminder to breathe, a steady pulse to guide, a silent bond to console—always syncs with you.<br/><br/>We walk together, We lift each other. We shine as one.<br/>Every rhythm, every spark—we share, fuel, and glow.<br/><br/></p>",
        "mobile_img_first": true,
        "mobile_img_has_back": false,
        "mobile_text_alignment": "center",
        "mobile_back_color": "",
        "mobile_font_color": "#1e0e06",
        "mobile_title_font_size": 28,
        "mobile_text_font_size": 16,
        "mobile_img_text_margin": 20,
        "mobile_padding_top": 36,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
